{"addedOn":10,"avgRating":["fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o"],"breadcrumbsHtml":"<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117\">OpenEdge Development: ABL Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/ABL-Syntax-Reference.html\">ABL Syntax Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<span class=\"active\">SSL-SERVER-NAME function</span>\n","class":"manual","created":1470,"dislikeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/dislike/310729","html":"<article class=\"hascomments\" data-page=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/SSL-SERVER-NAME-function.html\" id=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/SSL-SERVER-NAME-function.html\"><main role=\"main\"><article aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\" class=\"dita\" id=\"SSL-SERVER-NAME-function\" role=\"article\">\n  <h1 class=\"title topictitle1 reference\" id=\"ariaid-title1\">SSL-SERVER-NAME function</h1>\n  \n  <div class=\"body refbody\">\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"SSL-SERVER-NAME-function__section_N10024_N10021_N10001\">\n      <p class=\"p\">Returns the digital certificate subject name for an OpenEdge database\n        connected via SSL. If a database connection does not exist or the connection is not using\n        SSL (including a shared-memory connection), this function returns the Unknown value (<code class=\"ph codeph\">?</code>).</p>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"SSL-SERVER-NAME-function__syntax_GC1B18I2704303\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d371238e99\">Syntax</h2>\n      \n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"SSL-SERVER-NAME-function__idGDP2YI2676937\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n              <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>SSL-SERVER-NAME ( <var class=\"keyword varname\">logical-database-name</var> )</code></pre>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n      <dl class=\"dl parml\">\n        \n          <dt class=\"dt pt dlterm\">\n            <var class=\"keyword varname\">logical-database-name</var>\n          </dt>\n          <dd class=\"dd pd\">A quoted character string or character expression that specifies\nthe database by its logical name.</dd>\n        \n      </dl>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"SSL-SERVER-NAME-function__example_GC1B18J2704309\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d371238e143\">Example</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">The\nfollowing example returns the digital certificate subject name of\nthe database with the logical name <code class=\"ph codeph\">mydb</code>:</p>\n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"SSL-SERVER-NAME-function__idGDP2YJ2676943\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n              <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>SSL-SERVER-NAME(&quot;mydb&quot;).</code></pre>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"SSL-SERVER-NAME-function__see-also_GC1B18K2704315\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d371238e175\">See also</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">\n        <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"Server-object-handle.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/Server-object-handle.html\">Server object handle</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"Socket-object-handle.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/Socket-object-handle.html\">Socket object handle</a></p>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n<nav role=\"navigation\"><div class=\"familylinks\"><div class=\"previouslink\"><strong>Previous topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"SQRT-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/SQRT-function.html\">SQRT function</a></div><div class=\"nextlink\"><strong>Next topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"STATUS-statement.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/STATUS-statement.html\">STATUS statement</a></div></div></nav><nav class=\"related-links\" role=\"navigation\"></nav></article></main></article>\n","isWatched":false,"labelText":"Product; Product > OpenEdge; Product > OpenEdge > Version 11.7; Format; Format > Documentation","likes":0,"likeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/like/310729","myDocsURL":null,"numOfPageViews":0,"numOfRatingsText":"<span>0 Ratings","revised":219,"showWatch":false,"topicMeta":[["bookowner","oe11docs"],["bookrights","oe11docs"],["bundle","openedge-abl-reference-117"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge/product_openedge_117"],["data","OEInformationHub/format"],["data","OEInformationHub/format/format_documentation"],["organization","oe11docs"]],"topicTitle":"SSL-SERVER-NAME function","topicurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/SSL-SERVER-NAME-function.html","type":"Manual"}